<title>USA: Fieldcrest Cannon Inc Q4 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Fieldcrest Cannon Inc Q4 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>KANNAPOLIS, N.C. 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.13     loss	 $2.11</p>
<p> Net profit		 2,334     loss	17,729</p>
<p> Revs		     279,501		  284,612</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   9,087		    8,912</p>
<p>		     Year</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.38     loss	 $2.28</p>
<p> Net profit		 3,440     loss	15,725</p>
<p> Revs		  1,0292,496		1,095,193</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   9,024		    8,875</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Results include pretax restructuring charges of nil vs $4.9 million in quarter and $8.1 million vs $20.5 million in year which had a per share impact of $0.23, $0.56 and $1.37, respectively.</p>
<p>1996 Q4 net inclujdes gain of $6.1 million, or $0.42/shr, on sale of two distribution centers and a towel yarn facility.</p>
<p>Per share results after preferred dividends of $1,125,000 in both quarters and $4.5 million in both years.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
